      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Dog Sit Home, on rue d'Antibes in Cannes, is first and foremost a professional grooming salon and daycare. It also offers a self-service wash option — but keep in mind this is not a pure automated station like you might find elsewhere in the department, for example in Nice.</p>

